    'yurua.h2_1': "Three Ways to Decide",
    'yurua.p_1': "Open the app and choose what fits your current situation:",
    'yurua.li_1_1': "<strong>Yes / No:</strong> For either/or questions. Let yurua pick – and override it with a single tap if it feels wrong.",
    'yurua.li_1_2': "<strong>Small Selection:</strong> Enter 2 to 5 options. The suggested one stays, the others gently fade away.",
    'yurua.li_1_3': "<strong>Step by Step:</strong> For long lists that feel overwhelming. Simple, factual questions – like \"something familiar or something new?\" – gently narrow your choices until only a few manageable ones remain. No need to analyze your feelings.",

