    'yurua.li_2_2': "<strong>'Decide for Me':</strong> When your energy is low or you can't tell what you want, this button is always there. Let yurua choose at any point.",
    'yurua.li_2_3': "<strong>No Ticking Clocks:</strong> No timers, no demanding prompts, no auto-advance. Take your time and use yurua at your own pace.",
    'yurua.li_2_4': "<strong>Visual Silence:</strong> Soft edges, calm colors and slow fade animations instead of harsh lines and bright flashes. A quiet space that does not demand your attention.",

    'yurua.h2_3': "Made with PDA and Anxiety in Mind",
    'yurua.p_3': "Pathological Demand Avoidance and anxiety can make even helpful suggestions feel like pressure. yurua offers gentle guidance rather than another demand. If your mind resists a choice, that response is welcome: dismiss the option and continue until something feels workable – or stop whenever you want. yurua does not judge your choices or push you toward a particular answer.",

    'yurua.h2_4': "Respects Your Peace",
