    'yurua.li_4_3': "<strong>Fully Offline:</strong> Works anywhere, anytime – no internet connection needed.",
    'yurua.li_4_4': "<strong>No Notifications, No Streaks:</strong> yurua is there whenever you need it – and leaves you completely alone when you don't.",

