    'plus2048.heroImgAlt': "2048 Levels – the number 2048 with a glowing black hole in place of the zero",

    'plus2048.title': "2048 Levels",
    'plus2048.intro': "<strong>The swipe-and-merge idea you already know – turned into a handcrafted brainteaser.</strong> Slide all numbers at once, merge equal values and reach each level's goal. But this time, walls, holes and portals stand in your way. No timer, no daily streaks, no pop-ups and no ads. Just you, the grid and a minimalist design with a deep black OLED theme.",

    'plus2048.h2_1': "Obstacles That Change Everything",
    'plus2048.p_1': "55 campaign levels in eleven chapters introduce new obstacles one at a time:",
    'plus2048.li_1_1': "<strong>Walls:</strong> Halt sliding blocks so you can park your numbers safely. Fading walls vanish after a few moves, jumping walls reappear somewhere else.",
    'plus2048.li_1_2': "<strong>Black Holes:</strong> Swallow whatever slides in – tidy up small tiles or lose your best one.",
    'plus2048.li_1_3': "<strong>Picky Holes:</strong> Capacity holes close after a few blocks, filter holes accept only one exact value, sated holes take just one block per move, and wandering holes drift across the board in a steady rhythm.",
    'plus2048.li_1_4': "<strong>Brake Fields:</strong> Catch a sliding value halfway for precise positioning.",
    'plus2048.li_1_5': "<strong>Portals:</strong> Teleport blocks across the board – and they keep sliding in the same direction.",

    'plus2048.h2_2': "Calm, Fair & Free to Play",
    'plus2048.li_2_1': "<strong>Every Level Is Solvable:</strong> A solver checked each level across hundreds of random spawns. Fair puzzles, not luck.",
    'plus2048.li_2_2': "<strong>Undo Without Frustration:</strong> A free undo fixes any mis-swipe. Merging is about planning, not about punishing a slip.",
    'plus2048.li_2_3': "<strong>Classic 2048 Included:</strong> After the first chapter, you unlock the familiar endless 4×4 mode – free and without obstacles. Your best score is saved.",
    'plus2048.li_2_4': "<strong>Respects Your Peace:</strong> Works fully offline, without an account and without tracking. Pause any level and resume it whenever you like.",

    'plus2048.h2_3': "Challenge Your Friends",
    'plus2048.p_3': "Share any level as a link. Your friend plays the exact same level with the exact same random spawns – can they solve it in fewer moves? The comparison stays on your devices. No leaderboards, no accounts.",

    'plus2048.h2_4': "Premium – One-Time Purchase, No Subscription",
    'plus2048.p_4': "The core game stays free. If you want more, a single purchase unlocks:",
    'plus2048.li_4_1': "<strong>Time Traveler:</strong> Unlimited undo and redo – scrub freely through every move.",
    'plus2048.li_4_2': "<strong>The Lab:</strong> 105 handcrafted expert levels with wall mazes, wandering holes and portal networks.",
    'plus2048.li_4_3': "<strong>The Void:</strong> An endless 4×4, 5×5 or 6×6 challenge with obstacles that appear and vanish.",
    'plus2048.li_4_4': "<strong>Tactical Preview:</strong> See the value of the next tile before it spawns.",
    'plus2048.li_4_5': "<strong>4 Extra Color Themes:</strong> Each in light and dark.",

    'plus2048.ctaTitle': "Ready for a maze of numbers?",
    'plus2048.ctaDesc': "2048 Levels is available now. Start with 55 free levels and the classic mode today.",

    'plus2048.faq_title': "FAQ",
    'plus2048.faq_1_q': "What is 2048 Levels?",
    'plus2048.faq_1_a': "<b>2048 Levels</b> is a calm, level-based brainteaser built on the swipe-and-merge mechanics of 2048. Instead of an endless high-score grind, you solve handcrafted puzzles with walls, holes, brake fields and portals. If you like sokoban, sliding block puzzles or a relaxing logic game after work, it is made for you.",
    'plus2048.faq_2_q': "How is it different from classic 2048?",
    'plus2048.faq_2_a': "Classic 2048 is mostly about luck and endurance. In <b>2048 Levels</b>, every level has a goal and a layout with obstacles that change how numbers slide. It rewards planning instead of grinding. And if you just want the original, the classic endless mode is included for free.",
    'plus2048.faq_3_q': "Is it really free?",
    'plus2048.faq_3_a': "Yes. 55 campaign levels, the classic mode and a single undo are free – without ads. An optional one-time purchase unlocks expert levels, the endless Void mode, unlimited undo, a preview of the next tile and extra themes. No subscriptions, no in-game currencies.",
    'plus2048.faq_4_q': "Can every level really be solved, despite random spawns?",
    'plus2048.faq_4_a': "Yes. Every level was played by a solver with hundreds of different random spawn sequences. Only layouts that stay solvable made it into the game.",
    'plus2048.faq_5_q': "Do I need an account or an internet connection?",
    'plus2048.faq_5_a': "No. <b>2048 Levels</b> works completely offline, without an account and without tracking. Even sharing a challenge needs no account – the level and its random spawns are encoded in the link itself.",

    // 2048 Levels – Challenge
    'plus2048.challenge_pageTitle': "Challenge | 2048 Levels",
    'plus2048.challenge_pageDesc': "You've been challenged in 2048 Levels. Same level, same randomness – can you beat it in fewer moves?",
    'plus2048.challenge_title': "You've been challenged!",
    'plus2048.challenge_fromUnknown': "Someone challenged you in 2048 Levels.",
    'plus2048.challenge_fromNamed': "{name} challenged you in 2048 Levels.",
    'plus2048.challenge_intro': "Same level, same randomness – can you do it in fewer moves?",
    'plus2048.challenge_codeTitle': "Already have the app?",
    'plus2048.challenge_codeIntro': "Open <strong>Challenges → Enter code</strong> and paste this code:",
    'plus2048.challenge_copyBtn': "Copy code",
    'plus2048.challenge_copiedBtn': "Copied!",
    'plus2048.challenge_ctaTitle': "Get 2048 Levels",
    'plus2048.challenge_ctaDesc': "Install the app and accept the challenge.",
